const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Part 24, finally taking on our main objective!\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#The_Cavern_of_Earth\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Cavern of Earth</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#The_Depths_of_the_Earth\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Depths of the Earth</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Release_the_Seals\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Release the Seals</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#God_in_Fire\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">God in Fire</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#To_the_Desert\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">To the Desert</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#The_Flying_Castle\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Flying Castle</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Cavern_of_Earth\">The Cavern of Earth</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Cavern of Earth\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_24?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Cavern of Earth\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Bring along a Multichain, two Jump Chains, a Cross Chain, and a KP Gambler. If you have slots taken up by KP Bonuses, swing by the Frozen Continent Gateway and use them up KP grinding. Those five listed skills will be most useful, in that with them we can chain the floors that matter in terms of maximizing KP winnings. I also got Inferno Claws for Prishe, which Level 90 weapons you can get depend on how lucky you got with the chests in the two gateways. If you got a Darksteel Ingot or two you can get the Brave Blade and Save the Queen, which together with Eureka Metal get Excalibur, a Level 100 sword that, as a consequence of being a sword, most characters can equip. I mostly though still have my party with their Level 60 stuff. Either way, also leave on the Diamond gear. Head to the Cavern of Earth and dive in.\n</p><p>I'm not going to cover the first two floors since the layouts are so simple, don't waste chain skills here. You'll need to move about a bit and wait for the enemies to appear. The KP Chance is a 90 second win, and the bonus line is 70. Don't worry, from now on \"Bonus line\" is just a suggestion, the upcoming gateways have Level 97 and higher enemies, but the bonus line is 80. As we descend we hear the mured moogle deep in the gateway calling out to us to save him.\n</p><p>The first floor has a Level 72 Warrior of Antiquity with Zalera and an Idle Sky Pirate, and a Level 39 Fleeting Flash.\n</p><p>The second floor has a Level 39 Delusory Dragoon, a Level 74 Fallacious Giant with the Gilgamesh summon and Fallacious Tree Assist, and a Horror of Antiquity with Hecatoncheir and Lady of Antiquity. The normal chest has Destruction Resin, and the blue and gold chest has a Level 60 trade accessory.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Horror of Antiquity\"><img alt=\"Horror of Antiquity\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Booster Accessory x5\"><img alt=\"Booster Accessory x5\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:cente