ings.\n</p><p>On the floor, quest what chain skill to use where, come on, guess. Cross Chain at D4 to get them all, the purple emblem is a Stage BRV Boost, awesome.\n</p><p>The opposition is a bit more varied now. First, a Level 43 Imaginary Soldier, then a Level 40 Ephemeral Summoner, and third is a Level 43 Transient Lion. Then comes the Strange enemy, a Level 100 Fallacious Tree with Bahamut. Fifth, the Expert, a Level 82 Ephemeral Phantom with an Ephemeral Vision Assist and Malboro summon. Finally we tackle the Party piece, a Level 39 Idle Sky Pirate and a Level 39 Delusory Dragoon.\n</p><p>With them conquered, grab the moogle chalice to double our KP.\n</p><p>Not much further, kiddies.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235927\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lv. 60 armor component\"><img alt=\"Lv. 60 armor component\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Rare Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Rare_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203235927\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"m