ic.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>As we progress, the mured moogle remembers one thing - sealing a gateway on the path between the southern and northern continents.\n</p><p>Jump Chain at C3 or Multichain at C2. I, alas, have neither, so I manually chain them from B4. Oh well, you make due with what you have, right kiddies?\n</p><p>The Normal enemies are a Level 42 Phantasmal Girl and a Level 43 Imaginary Soldier. The Party consists of a Level 39 Fleeting Flash, Idle Sky Pirate, and Delusory Dragoon...I guess we've come first circle, the first chapter of the game just reused those three guys over and over after all. The two Experts are a Level 80 Counterfeit Wraith with Atomos and Counterfeit Youth, and a Level 81 Delusory Warlock with Giant of Babil and Delusory Knight.\n</p><p>Well, another floor down, grab your spoils and head down.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">I\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40