/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Brawler\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Brawler\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Diamond Ring\"><img alt=\"Diamond Ring\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235927\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lufenian Equipment\"><img alt=\"Lufenian Equipment\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Rare Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Rare_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203235927\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Immediately as we enter, the seal at D2 shatters to allow us access to the rare chest with 30,000 gil. I have to wonder why the seal is there at all, but a minor detail.\n</p><p>A Multichain at E3 will get many of the enemies, but the bonus line is 80, and since you're likely Level 100, that's a -20 penalty and overall only a 25 KP score, so don't waste a chain skill. Unless, of course, you have a KP Gambler with you, and if you don't go get one, in fact get two, we'll use one in the next gateway as well. The KP Chance is a 60 second win, go to the southern isle where the moogle sells trade items and attack skills and grab a Maser Eye or other skill to help you out if you think you need it.\n</p><p>The enemies are a Level 97 Fleeting Flash with the Odin summon and a Delusory Warlock Assist, a Level 97 Idle Sky Pirate with Cactuar and a Warrior of Antiquity, a Level 97 Imaginary Brawler with an unknown summon and an Imaginary Champion Assist, and a Level 97 Delusory Dragoon with Alexander and a Fleeting Flash. The usual enemies have come a long way haven't they? The Party piece is much less impressive, a Level 71 Lady of Antiquity with Carbuncle and a Horror of Antiquity, and a Level 72 Warrior of Antiquity with Zalera and an Idle Sky Pirate.\n</p><p>The normal chest has a Diamond Ring, and the rare chest has a random piece of Lufenian equipment. The Lufenian equipment is a set of Level 100 gear, there's a piece for every equipment type, the combination effects are lame but in terms of pure stats they're probably the best stuff you can get at the moment. I recommend farming equipment pieces from this gateway a few times, kill the lone enemy at C5, grab the chest and exit and re-enter. Weapons are most valuable, since you may want to keep using Diamond or Gold equipment for their effects. The Lufenian items have one of two combination abilities, Seal or Judgement. Both are 3-piece abilities, one gives Assist Gauge Depletion, the other gives EX Gauge Depletion, but the devs didn't split the distribution of the two skills well, many characters flat cannot equip three pieces of Lufenian gear with the same ability, not to mention that as I said, the effects aren't very good anyway.\n</p><p>Head left beyond the gateway and shatter the rock to reach an island with an Elixir. Continue north to a second rock, leading to an island with our good old friend, RoboMog. He has several \"Recipe\" items, which are needed to trade for high-level equipment and accessories, one each, and aren't acquired anywhere else. Buy one of each, if you like, but if you just want the best that would be Gemini and Aries. The Gemini Recipe unlocks Dangerously Lucky, which increases item drop rate by 75% and acts like an Iifa Leaf too. The Aries unlocks the Miracle Shoes, which you can get now, they give a few minor helpful effects. Further north there's a chest with a Diamond, and of course the next gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pebble\"><img alt=\"Pebble\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Despot\"><img alt=\"Imitation Despot\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert