antasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Soldier\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Soldier\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Horror of Antiquity\"><img alt=\"Horror of Antiquity\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chain Skill\"><img alt=\"Chain Skill\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stage BRV Boost\"><img alt=\"Stage BRV Boost\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/9/9f/D012_Mirror_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20111218224444\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mirror Battle\"><img alt=\"Mirror Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Mirror Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Mirror_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/9/9f/D012_Mirror_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/14?cb=20111218224444\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Lion\"><img alt=\"Transient Lion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The mured moogle notes, there's Lufenian technology to dig up here. Lightning is leading the pack again for this gateway. Multichain at E4 with a KP Gambler to get all the enemies, the blue emblem is a Booster x5. The bonus line is 100 and the KP Chance is a 30 second win.\n</p><p>We begin with the Strange enemy, a Level 100 Transient Lion with Bahamut, Mystic Flurry, Beat Fang and Blasting Zone. Then, a Level 79 Warrior of Antiquity with Zalera, a Level 80 Horror of Antiquity with Hecatoncheir, a Level 100 Imaginary Soldier with Bahamut and an Imaginary Brawler, and a Level 100 Transient Lion with the Magus Sisters and a Transient Gunner. The Soldier is fought in Planet's Core Ω, of course, the worst arena in the game for a time limit thanks to the horrible AI - scratch that actually, it <i>knows</i> you're on a time limit and thus runs away to screw you over. Bring along a summon like Behemoth or Tiamat so your HP attacks do as much damage as possible. The Lion has the manual Magus Sisters, so you can avoid them by making sure the HP attack that Breaks him deals HP damage soon after, before he can call the Sisters. Overall the two are quite annoying and there were many retries from me. Those Lufenian weapons help a lot, you'd be surprised how much difference 4 ATK makes.\n</p><p>With them dead, open the chests for a Diamond Ring and a random skill, then fight either Mirror piece (I think the devs forgot which side we enter this floor from when placing the emblems), and head down to floor 2. Don't worry, this gateway is only 5 floors.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Tree\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Tree\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Lion\"><img alt=\"Transient Lion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-